<BaseLayout title="Privacy & licensing" description="Privacy, analytics and licensing notes for the PlayMAKER organization website." path="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Site information</p><h1>Privacy & licensing.</h1><p class="section-lede">A lightweight public website, with clear limits on what is shared and reused.</p></div></section>
  <section class="page-section"><div class="shell copy-section"><h2>Privacy</h2><p>This site has no account, contact form, analytics, advertising scripts or cookies set by its own code. It is served through GitHub Pages; GitHub may process technical request data under its own policies. Following external links opens third-party sites governed by their policies.</p><h2>Software licenses</h2><p>PlayMAKER projects are developed in the open. A project's reuse terms depend on the license in that specific repository. Check the relevant <code>LICENSE</code> file before copying or distributing code. A public repository alone does not grant a software license.</p><h2>Images and club media</h2><p>Product artwork comes from the PlayMAKER organization assets. Club names, photographs, marks and other media may have separate rights and are not automatically open-source. The Nerone pilot is attributed without reproducing club media.</p><h2>Brand</h2><p>PlayMAKER is used here as the project name. The site does not claim a registered trademark or imply that the name and handle have been cleared for every use.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
